common_passwords.txt: the 10,000 most common passwords (in order), from the "passwords" frequency list of
zxcvbn 4.5.0 (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2016 Daniel Wolf; data from Mark Burnett's public 10-million-password
list), plus ~140 common 10+ character passwords added by ReelVault. Used only to refuse weak new passwords (11.1).
